%% Container-level sequence: SD-02 View historical measurements (UC-03; FR-02, FR-03, FR-04)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor AN as Energy Analyst
  participant WEB as Web Dashboard<br/>(src/frontend)
  participant API as Backend API<br/>(api/measurements.py)
  participant DB as Energy Database<br/>(SQLite)

  AN->>WEB: open History page, pick date range + variables
  WEB->>API: GET /api/measurements?start=...&end=...&fields=Appliances,T1,RH_1
  API->>API: validate range (start < end, within dataset)
  alt invalid range
    API-->>WEB: 422 {detail}
    WEB-->>AN: show validation message
  else valid
    API->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE timestamp BETWEEN start AND end
    DB-->>API: rows
    API->>API: downsample if > 5,000 points, compute summary stats
    API-->>WEB: 200 {points[], summary{min,mean,max}}
    WEB-->>AN: render energy, temperature and humidity charts
  end
